content+='<div class="notice"><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><p>Quotes are limited excerpts from organizer or official administrator pages. They support only the labeled fields, not every claim on the destination page. Source availability is not verification.</p></div><div class="source-index panel"><strong>Jump to an event</strong><div>'+source_index+'</div></div>'+''.join(notebook)
